  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ba7ada5a-a007-52aa-af00-48e734b632c2" activityNameId="8760575a-535d-595a-be27-dff5dbaee797" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Crude oil, production RLA, at long distance transport</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Crude oil, production RLA, at long distance transport
Transport of Latin American crude oil by pipeline to loading station and by tanker to European sites at the Mediterranean Sea, followed by pipeline transport to Switzerland. Weighted average transport distance calculated by tanker calculated for Caracas and Rio de Janeiro to Marseille. Onshore production of crude oil is modelled by the dataset for the Saudi Arabia and offshore production is approximated by the situation in Great Britain. The shares of onshore and offshore production were estimated based on EIA information for Venezuela and Brazil.;
UUID: bb3378d2-1cf2-3368-a1ce-89571455ffde
Transportation of crude oil from exploration site to refinery in Switzerland. Includes transport service requirements and emissions from oil handling and evaporation.
Location: Calculations based on assumptions for supply to Swiss refineries.
Technology: Operation of crude oil pipelines by electricity.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, statistics and own calculations. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bb3378d2-1cf2-3368-a1ce-89571455ffde.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
